<title>USA: First Commonwealth monthly distribution.</title>
<headline>First Commonwealth monthly distribution.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Commonwealth Fund Inc said Wednesday it will pay a monthly distribution of $0.0825 per share and a special year-end distribution of $0.02 per share on Jan 17 to shareholders of record Dec 31.</p>
<p>The special distribution consists of $0.015 per share in long-term capital gains and $0.005 per share in net investment income.</p>
<p>The company's previous monthly distribution was also $0.0825. The board of directors, reviewing the level of the monthly distribution at a meeting held on December 10 1996, said they are determined to maintain the distribution at its current level of $0.0825 per share.</p>
<p>First Commonwealth Fund is a close-end bond fund.</p>
</text>
